    "text": "<p>Given the hypothetical reaction mechanism</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi>II</mi></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mover><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi>III</mi></mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mover><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi>IV</mi></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></math> and the rate as</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>Species formed</td>\t\t\t<td>Rate of its information</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>002</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></math> per mole of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>030</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></math> per mole of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>011</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></math> per mole of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>420</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>mol</mi><mo>/</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi></math> per mole of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>The rate determining step is</p>",
